"Volcengine rejected the credentials (%@). Check the key — and the App ID, for old-console credentials — in Settings → AI & Engines." = "火山引擎拒绝了凭证（%@）。请在“设置”→“AI 与引擎”中检查密钥——旧版控制台凭证还需检查 App ID。";
"Volcengine rejected the request: %@" = "火山引擎拒绝了请求：%@";
"Volcengine request failed (HTTP %@)." = "火山引擎请求失败（HTTP %@）。";
"Google Translate" = "Google 翻译";
"Volcengine" = "火山引擎";
"The model" = "模型";
"NyCopilot couldn’t open its data." = "NyCopilot 无法打开它的数据。";
"The core returned no result." = "核心没有返回结果。";
"A note can hold up to 64 KB of text." = "一条笔记最多可容纳 64 KB 文字。";
"Add a Volcengine API key in Settings → AI & Engines." = "请在“设置”→“AI 与引擎”中添加火山引擎 API 密钥。";
"Can’t find the host. Check the URL in Settings." = "找不到主机。请在设置中检查 URL。";
"Can’t reach the server. Is it running?" = "无法连接服务器。它在运行吗？";
"Choose a folder on this Mac." = "请选择本机上的一个文件夹。";
